  "description": "Maintained catalog of known AI coding agent CLIs. The dashboard merges this list with live detection: entries installed on the machine appear under Installed; the rest appear under Available to Install. Add a new agent here (and bump `version`) to surface it in the GUI. Install/uninstall commands are the ONLY commands the dashboard is allowed to execute. For adapter-backed entries `binaries` is derived from the adapter at runtime — declare it here only for non-adapter entries (see the allow-list in agent-catalog.test.ts). `settingsPaths` lets non-adapter entries be detected by their config footprint too. Path research: research/ai-agent-config-paths-consolidated.md (2026-08-21).",
